  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Water Management in the SADC/Zambezi Region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">I. The objective is to support equitable and reasonable utilisation of the water resources of the Zambezi watercourse as well as the efficient management and sustainable development thereof. And the immediate objective is to support ZAMCOM in establishing and operationalizing its functioning as a river basin organisation providing efficient and timely support to the cooperation among the Riparian states and capable of planning and organising basin-wide activities.

II. The objective is to strengthen cooperative management and development in the Zambezi River Basin.

III The objective is to Improve management of the Regional Strategic Action Plan on Integrated Water Resources Development and Management (RSAP) and Increased regional dialogue and awareness of IWRM&#x201d;.</narrative>
  </description>
